---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Andrea Bergia's Website
description: Andrea Bergia's Website – developer, gamer, cat lover, tea addict.
---

<div class="post-header-section">
  <div class="post-header-content">
    <div class="home-header">
      <eleventy-image src="{{ '/images/me2025-rustlab.jpg' | base64 }}" alt="{{ site.author.name | base64 }}"></eleventy-image>
      <div class="home-header-text">
        <h1>Hi, I'm Andrea</h1>
        <p class="home-intro">Welcome to my website!<br>My name is <span class="home-my-name">Andrea Bergia</span>, I am a software engineer with over 15 years of experience, and this is my little corner of the Internet.&nbsp;🇮🇹&nbsp;🇪🇺</p>
        <p>You can find here my blog, where I write about programming, compilers, Rust, Java, or about cool stuff I find on the web.</p>
        <div class="home-actions">
          <a href="/about/" class="home-action home-action-secondary">About me</a>
          <a href="/post/" class="home-action home-action-primary">Read the blog</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="post-content-section">
  <div class="post-content-wrapper">
    <div class="home-columns">
      {% set recentPosts = collections.recentPosts %}
      {% if recentPosts and recentPosts.length %}
      <section>
        <h2 class="section-title"><svg class="section-icon section-icon-recent" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10 10-4.5 10-10S17.5 2 12 2zm0 18c-4.41 0-8-3.59-8-8s3.59-8 8-8 8 3.59 8 8-3.59 8-8 8zm.5-13H11v6l5.25 3.15.75-1.23-4.5-2.67z"/></svg> Recent Posts</h2>
        <ul class="post-list post-list--stacked post-list--recent">
          {% for post in recentPosts %}
          <li>
            <a href="{{ post.url }}">
              <span class="post-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
              <span class="post-meta">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <p class="view-all-posts">
          <a href="/post/">View all posts →</a>
        </p>
      </section>
      {% else %}
      <p>No posts yet. Migration in progress.</p>
      {% endif %}

      {% if collections.featuredPosts and collections.featuredPosts.length %}
      <section>
        <h2 class="section-title"><svg class="section-icon section-icon-featured" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg> Featured Posts</h2>
        <div class="featured-grid">
          {% for post in collections.featuredPosts %}
          <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="featured-card interactive-card">
            <span class="featured-card-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
            <span class="featured-card-meta">
              {{ post.date | readableDate }}
            </span>
            {% if post.data.excerpt %}
            <span class="featured-card-excerpt">{{ post.data.excerpt }}</span>
            {% else %}
            <span class="featured-card-excerpt">{{ post.templateContent | excerpt }}</span>
            {% endif %}
          </a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </section>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
